+  - Proposed a TensorFlow case validating real face images used by the model, covering effectiveness and privacy.
+- title: Travel-expense approval system (AEJ Travel and Ground Transportation)
+  time: 2022.07 - 2022.08
+  company: Nomura Holdings, Inc. · Global Infrastructure Services (GIS)
+  position: GIS Development Intern
+  content:
